[Title: Buff Cat Robot] [Title: Buff Panman Hero] A funny drawing... Well, what would appeal to elementary schoolers... A buff Panman hero, a buff cat-shaped robot, maybe that? Like Honyaemon made buff, or Funyapanman made buff. Buff... Well, let's just go with a buff Panman for now. I'll make it buff.

